<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-COLLATED RESULTS OF AFRICAN CUP GAMES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COLLATED RESULTS OF AFRICAN CUP GAMES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results of African</p>
<p>club competition quarter-final, first leg soccer matches played</p>
<p>at the weekend:</p>
<p>African Champions Cup:</p>
<p> Orlando Pirates (South Africa) 1 Shooting Stars (Nigeria)    0</p>
<p> Petro Atletico (Angola)	  1 JS Kabylie (Algeria)	  1</p>
<p> Zamalek (Egypt)		    2 COD Meknes (Morocco)	  0</p>
<p> CS Sfaxien (Tunisia)	     5 Diaraf Dakar (Senegal)	0</p>
<p>African Cup Winners' Cup:</p>
<p>CR Belouizdad (Algeria) walkover v Pretoria City (South Africa)</p>
<p>- withdrew</p>
<p> Sodigraf (Zaire)		   2 Katsina United (Nigeria)    0</p>
<p> FUS Rabat (Morocco)		0 Arab Contractors (Egypt)    0</p>
<p> Canon Yaounde (Cameroon)	 0 Costa do Sol (Mozambique)   0</p>
<p>Confederation of African Football (CAF) Cup:</p>
<p> Stade Tamponnaise (Reunion)    0 Kawkab Marrakesh (Morocco)   0</p>
<p> Kenya Breweries (Kenya)	1 Ports Authority (Sierra Leone) 0</p>
<p>    Etoile Sahel (Tunisia)	4 Unisport Bafang (Cameroon)   1</p>
<p> Mouloudia Oran (Algeria)	 2 Vita Club (Zaire)		0</p>
<p>Second leg matches will be played on the weekend of</p>
<p>September 20-22</p>
</text>
